# AD4Merz.dat -- modified AD4Zn.dat with literature metal-ion parameters
# for the Tier-1 metal path in code/vina_dock.py (engine 'ad4-merz').
# Divalent metals: Li & Merz 12-6-4 set, TIP3P water (JCTC 2014, 10, 289);
#   AD4 atom_par Rii = 2 x Rmin/2, epsii = eps (12-6 part of 12-6-4; the
#   r^-4 induced-dipole term is NOT representable in AutoGrid maps).
# Monovalent: Joung & Cheatham TIP3P monovalent set (JPCB 2008).
# Everything else (H-bond/solparam tables, FE coeffs, the calibrated Zn/TZ
# pairwise scheme) is identical to the stock AD4Zn.dat from the official
# AutoDock-Vina repo -- the zinc pipeline is unchanged, and the AD4Zn.dat
# engine ('ad4map') keeps the ORIGINAL stock Mg/Ca/Mn/Fe/Zn parameters.
